<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 4.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL KRAKOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two kerb transactions in 200,000 shares of Polish construction firm Mostostal Krakow SA at four zlotys each were struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shares in Mostostal Krakow, which has chosen not to conduct a public offering, have already been approved for main market trade by the Polish bourse and securities commission.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
